The {{Term/Store|Ancient Set|Ancient Set|Series, BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="CaC 185"/> also known as the '''Ancient Armor''',{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="BotW Nintendo 70"/> and the {{Term/Store|Ancient Soldier Gear|Ancient Soldier Gear|SSBU}},{{Exp Game|SSBU}}{{Name Ref|SSBU}} is a recurring Item in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Ancient Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Ancient Helm]], [[Ancient Cuirass]], and [[Ancient Greaves]]. Each piece of the Ancient Set can be purchased at the [[Akkala Ancient Tech Lab]] where [[Cherry|Ancient Oven]] will construct them from various ancient materials. 

Each piece of the Ancient Set reduces the damage taken from Guardians and Weapons with the Ancient Technology property. Wearing the Armor Set provides the Ancient Proficiency Set Bonus, which increases damage from all ancient Weapons by 80%. In addition to its useful bonuses, the Armor has a very high defense level, on par with the [[Soldier's Set]].

