==Other Appearances==
==={{SSBU|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Main|Mii Headgear, Mii Outfit}}
The Ancient Soldier Gear appears as a [[Mii Headgear|Headgear]] and [[Mii Outfit|Outfit]] for Mii Fighters. While the Ancient Helm can be worn by any Mii, only [[Mii Swordfighter]]s can wear the Ancient Soldier Gear. Included as part of version 7.0.0; it is an exclusive bonus received as part of the [[Fighters Pass Vol. 2]], released on January 28, 2020.
{{Noncanon|End}}

